W2  THE INTEGRATED ADVANCE ACROSS ONE SWITCHING SHELL: G M_b/(6 c^2), symbolically and numerically
========================================================================================================
    (c_T - 1) = f'(x) * G**(3/2)*M**(3/2)*sqrt(a_0)/(3*H**2*c**2*r**3) ;   dr = -G**(1/4)*M**(1/4)*a_0**(1/4)/(2*H*x**(3/2)) dx
    Int (c_T - 1) dr = Int f'(x) dx * [G*M/(6*c**2)]
    M_b = 1e+09 Msun: Int(c_T - 1)dr / [G M_b/(6c^2) * Delta f] over ten shapes = 0.9987 .. 0.9989;  advance 0.23 h
    M_b = 1e+10 Msun: Int(c_T - 1)dr / [G M_b/(6c^2) * Delta f] over ten shapes = 0.9977 .. 0.9980;  advance 2.28 h
    M_b = 6e+10 Msun: Int(c_T - 1)dr / [G M_b/(6c^2) * Delta f] over ten shapes = 0.9964 .. 0.9968;  advance 13.64 h
    M_b = 3e+11 Msun: Int(c_T - 1)dr / [G M_b/(6c^2) * Delta f] over ten shapes = 0.9947 .. 0.9953;  advance 68.10 h
